on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 16 ............................. <16>
  [  3] pushint8 20 ............................. <20>
  [  6] pushint8 13 ............................. <13>
  [  9] get 6 ................................... <the locH of sprite 20>
  [ 11] pushint8 13 ............................. <13>
  [ 14] set 6 ................................... set the locH of sprite 16 to the locH of sprite 20
  [ 16] pushint8 16 ............................. <16>
  [ 19] pushint8 20 ............................. <20>
  [ 22] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 25] get 6 ................................... <the locV of sprite 20>
  [ 27] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 30] set 6 ................................... set the locV of sprite 16 to the locV of sprite 20
  [ 32] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 34] extcall 12 .............................. updateStage()
  [ 36] pushsymb 42 ............................. <#playFile>
  [ 39] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 42] getglobal 21 ............................ <effectspath>
  [ 44] pushcons 0 .............................. <"floor.aif">
  [ 46] joinstr ................................. <effectspath & "floor.aif">
  [ 47] pusharglistnoret 3 ...................... <1, effectspath & "floor.aif">
  [ 49] extcall 43 .............................. sound playFile 1, effectspath & "floor.aif"
  [ 52] ret
end
